WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:03.501
-Welcome, welcome.
Welcome to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.501 --> 00:00:04.734
You're here.
You're watching.

00:00:04.734 --> 00:00:06.067
Thank you.

00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:07.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:08.501
Hey, guys. This is fun.

00:00:08.501 --> 00:00:11.234
Tomorrow is Earth Day.

00:00:11.234 --> 00:00:12.367
Yeah.

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:14.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.734 --> 00:00:17.767
And for everyone who went
a little too hard on 420,

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:19.167
it's come back to Earth Day.

00:00:19.167 --> 00:00:20.567
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.567 --> 00:00:21.767
That's right,
tomorrow is Earth Day.

00:00:21.767 --> 00:00:23.100
Right now, the Earth is like,

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.200
"So I get a day,
but sharks get a week?

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.267
I don't understand."

00:00:26.267 --> 00:00:27.901
Well, some news from Washington.

00:00:27.901 --> 00:00:29.801
According to a new poll,
Mitch McConnell

00:00:29.801 --> 00:00:32.801
is the least popular senator
in the U.S.

00:00:32.801 --> 00:00:35.167
with only a 28%
approval rating.

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:37.501
Yeah, well, I think some other
senators feel bad for McConnell.

00:00:37.501 --> 00:00:39.901
So they reached out
with words of encouragement.

00:00:39.901 --> 00:00:41.901
For example,
Senator James Lankford said...

00:00:45.901 --> 00:00:47.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.834 --> 00:00:49.033
Senator Cory Booker said...

00:00:52.634 --> 00:00:54.801
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.868 --> 00:00:59.467
And then --

00:00:59.467 --> 00:01:00.934
then Senator
Peter Welch said...

00:01:04.467 --> 00:01:07.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.601 --> 00:01:08.868
And Senator Jon Ossoff said...

00:01:13.634 --> 00:01:15.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.701 --> 00:01:17.167
Then Senator
Roger Marshall said...

00:01:21.734 --> 00:01:24.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:25.367
And Senator Bob Menendez said...

00:01:29.634 --> 00:01:32.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.801 --> 00:01:34.133
-People are cruel.

00:01:34.133 --> 00:01:35.968
-And finally,
Senator Jon Tester said...

00:01:40.601 --> 00:01:42.367
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:42.367 --> 00:01:44.100
Wow.

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:45.734
-Wow.

00:01:45.734 --> 00:01:48.601
-They're trying to help me.

00:01:48.601 --> 00:01:49.968
Well, here's some
big political news.

00:01:49.968 --> 00:01:52.501
I read that President Biden
is planning to announce

00:01:52.501 --> 00:01:55.634
his reelection campaign
next week.

00:01:55.634 --> 00:01:57.334
Does Biden even need
to campaign?

00:01:57.334 --> 00:01:59.033
I mean, he's run
for president three times.

00:01:59.033 --> 00:02:02.400
Who's got to be like, I got to
learn more about this guy.

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:04.200
Yet the announcement
will be early next week,

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:05.901
Biden said before
getting down to business,

00:02:05.901 --> 00:02:07.234
"I just want
to enjoy Coachella."

00:02:07.234 --> 00:02:09.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.434 --> 00:02:10.834
Well, speaking of Coachella,

00:02:10.834 --> 00:02:13.267
today the final weekend
kicked off.

00:02:13.267 --> 00:02:16.033
Yep, so between Coachella
and the new "Super Mario" movie,

00:02:16.033 --> 00:02:17.801
it's been a big month
for mushrooms.

00:02:17.801 --> 00:02:19.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.067 --> 00:02:23.133
Yeah, a lot of people
are excited

00:02:23.133 --> 00:02:25.000
for the second weekend
of Coachella.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.234
I actually just saw
an ad for it.

00:02:26.234 --> 00:02:27.567
Check this out.

00:02:27.567 --> 00:02:29.968
-This year's Coachella
has the most packed lineup.

00:02:51.567 --> 00:02:54.968
-Wow, that's a lot of letters.
Ba-ba-ba-ba-ba.

00:02:54.968 --> 00:02:56.734
[ Humming "Seinfeld" theme ]

00:02:56.734 --> 00:02:58.067
That's the band name?

00:02:58.067 --> 00:02:59.434
[ Laughs ]

00:02:59.434 --> 00:03:00.968
-Hey, guys,
people are talking about this.

00:03:00.968 --> 00:03:04.234
I heard that Kylie Jenner and
Timothée Chalamet are dating.

00:03:04.234 --> 00:03:05.467
[ Record scratch ]

00:03:05.467 --> 00:03:09.267
-Say what?!

00:03:09.267 --> 00:03:10.767
-Yes, yes.

00:03:10.767 --> 00:03:13.033
Apparently they've been sneaking
around for months,

00:03:13.033 --> 00:03:15.067
with sources saying Kylie
has mostly been

00:03:15.067 --> 00:03:17.267
hanging out at his house.

00:03:17.267 --> 00:03:20.467
-Say what?!

00:03:20.467 --> 00:03:22.434
-Not only that,
but there are reports

00:03:22.434 --> 00:03:26.067
that the two were seen
kissing backstage at Coachella.

00:03:26.067 --> 00:03:28.701
-Say what?!

00:03:28.701 --> 00:03:29.834
-And that's not all.

00:03:29.834 --> 00:03:31.300
After that, I heard they might
even go on

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:33.467
a double date with
Kendall Jenner and Bad Bunny.

00:03:33.467 --> 00:03:35.567
-Enough, Jimmy.
Enough.

00:03:35.567 --> 00:03:36.634
I can't take it.

00:03:36.634 --> 00:03:38.434
It's too much gossip.

00:03:38.434 --> 00:03:47.834
♪♪

00:03:47.834 --> 00:03:50.167
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.901 --> 00:03:56.300
-Finally I saw that Carnival
band to cruise passengers

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:59.367
because they were caught fishing
from the balcony in their room.

00:03:59.367 --> 00:04:01.467
[ Laughter ]

00:04:02.801 --> 00:04:05.767
Unfortunately, their room
overlooked the pool,

00:04:05.767 --> 00:04:06.767
but they did pretty well.

00:04:06.767 --> 00:04:07.934
They caught six retirees

00:04:07.934 --> 00:04:09.234
and a crappy magician.

00:04:09.234 --> 00:04:10.834
Yeah, we have a great show.

00:04:10.834 --> 00:04:12.767
Let's go write some
thank you notes. Come on.

00:04:12.767 --> 00:04:14.634
-♪ The man at hand
that rule the school ♪

00:04:14.634 --> 00:04:17.067
♪ And reach and teach the blind
and find a way from A to Z ♪

00:04:17.067 --> 00:04:18.767
♪ And be the most to boast
I'm loud and proud ♪

00:04:18.767 --> 00:04:21.200
♪ The game and reign
that remain ♪

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:24.400
♪ The heat is on
so feel the fire ♪

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:25.968
-Today is Friday,

00:04:25.968 --> 00:04:28.033
and that's usually when I catch
up on some personal stuff.

00:04:28.033 --> 00:04:30.400
You know, I check my inbox,
I returns some emails,

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:32.334
and of course,
I send out thank you notes.

00:04:32.334 --> 00:04:34.234
And I was running --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:34.234 --> 00:04:36.100
running a bit behind today,

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:37.534
so I thought if you guys
wouldn't mind,

00:04:37.534 --> 00:04:39.167
I'd like to write out my weekly
thank you notes right now.

00:04:39.167 --> 00:04:40.167
Is that okay with you?

00:04:40.167 --> 00:04:41.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:41.934 --> 00:04:43.100
Appreciate it.
James, can I get some

00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:44.868
thank you note
writing music, please?

00:04:44.868 --> 00:04:46.601
-Oh, there you go.

00:04:46.601 --> 00:04:48.567
[ Laughter ]

00:04:48.567 --> 00:04:51.567
Oh
-Oh.

00:04:51.567 --> 00:04:52.734
It's like dog head.

00:04:52.734 --> 00:04:54.734
♪♪

00:04:54.734 --> 00:04:57.667
-Thank you,
Ron DeSantis' ongoing feud

00:04:57.667 --> 00:05:00.400
with Disney World,
for making even parents

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.467
say let it go.

00:05:02.467 --> 00:05:04.467
[ Applause ]

00:05:09.701 --> 00:05:14.067
Thank you, weed gummies,
for coming in two varieties --

00:05:14.067 --> 00:05:16.968
barely feel it or enter
the 11th dimension.

00:05:16.968 --> 00:05:18.067
[ Applause ]

00:05:18.067 --> 00:05:20.434
Whoa.

00:05:20.434 --> 00:05:22.601
-[ Groaning ]

00:05:22.601 --> 00:05:23.968
[ Slow motion ] Jimmy.

00:05:23.968 --> 00:05:25.133
-Oh, wow.

00:05:25.133 --> 00:05:27.934
[ Laughter ]

00:05:27.934 --> 00:05:30.434
-Thank you,
"Super Mario Bros. Movie,"

00:05:30.434 --> 00:05:33.267
for being expected
to make $1 billion,

00:05:33.267 --> 00:05:35.167
