00:06:08.801 --> 00:06:10.701
-Ah, ooh.
-Ooh.

00:06:10.701 --> 00:06:12.734
Ah, ooh, ah.
That's my favorite.

00:06:12.734 --> 00:06:14.968
Ooh, ah.
No, that one's my favorite.

00:06:14.968 --> 00:06:16.734
